{"phrase|bismillah":{"easy":"In the name of God, the Most Merciful, the Especially Merciful.","kind":"phrase","type":["bismillah","bismilla","bismillahi","bismillah ir rahman ir rahim","in the name of god","in the name of allah","basmala","basmalah","begin with god's name","start in the name of god"],"note":"These words open every surah except Surah 9.","check":false,"n":3000,"r":[],"ph":{"ar":"بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ","translit":"bismi allahi ar-raḥmāni ar-raḥīmi","ref":"1:1","parts":[{"ar":"بِسْمِ","say":"in the name of"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","say":"God"},{"ar":"ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ","say":"the Most Merciful, whose mercy reaches everyone"},{"ar":"ٱلرَّحِيمِ","say":"the Especially Merciful, always kind"}]}},"phrase|alhamdulillah":{"easy":"All praise belongs to God, the Lord of all the worlds.","kind":"phrase","type":["alhamdulillah","alhamdulilah","alhamdu lillah","alhamdulillahi rabbil alamin","praise be to god","all praise is for god","thank god","praise god","hamd"],"note":null,"check":false,"n":3000,"r":[],"ph":{"ar":"ٱلْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ رَبِّ ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ","translit":"al-ḥamdu lillahi rabbi al-ʿālamīna","ref":"1:2","parts":[{"ar":"ٱلْحَمْدُ","say":"all praise"},{"ar":"لِلَّهِ","say":"belongs to God"},{"ar":"رَبِّ","say":"the Lord, who owns and looks after everything"},{"ar":"ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ","say":"all the worlds"}]}},"phrase|la-ilaha-illa-allah":{"easy":"There is no god but God.","kind":"phrase","type":["la ilaha illallah","la ilaha illa allah","la ilah illa allah","shahada","shahadah","no god but god","there is no god but allah","tawhid","oneness of god"],"note":"This is the first part of the shahada.","check":false,"n":3000,"r":[],"ph":{"ar":"لَآ إِلَٰهَ إِلَّا ٱللَّهُ","translit":"lā ilāha illā allahu","ref":"47:19","parts":[{"ar":"لَآ","say":"no"},{"ar":"إِلَٰهَ","say":"god"},{"ar":"إِلَّا","say":"except"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","say":"God"}]}},"phrase|inna-lillahi":{"easy":"We belong to God, and to Him we return.","kind":"phrase","type":["inna lillahi wa inna ilayhi rajiun","inna lillahi","inna lillah","to god we belong and to him we return","we belong to god","when someone dies","words for bad news","rajioon"],"note":"The Quran gives these words for people who are hit by a hard loss.","check":false,"n":3000,"r":[],"ph":{"ar":"إِنَّا لِلَّهِ وَإِنَّآ إِلَيْهِ رَٰجِعُونَ","translit":"innā lillahi waʾinnā ilayhi rājiʿūna","ref":"2:156","parts":[{"ar":"إِنَّا","say":"we"},{"ar":"لِلَّهِ","say":"belong to God"},{"ar":"وَإِنَّآ","say":"and we"},{"ar":"إِلَيْهِ","say":"to Him"},{"ar":"رَٰجِعُونَ","say":"are returning"}]}},"phrase|subhanallah":{"easy":"Glory be to God: He is far above any fault.","kind":"phrase","type":["subhanallah","subhan allah","subhanalla","subhanallahi","glory be to god","how perfect is god","tasbih","exalted is god","far above every fault"],"note":null,"check":false,"n":3000,"r":[],"ph":{"ar":"سُبْحَٰنَ ٱللَّهِ","translit":"subḥāna allahi","ref":"23:91","parts":[{"ar":"سُبْحَٰنَ","say":"glory be, far above every fault"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","say":"to God"}]}},"phrase|insha-allah":{"easy":"If God wills.","kind":"phrase","type":["inshallah","insha allah","inshaallah","in sha allah","god willing","if god wills","if allah wills","inshaa allah"],"note":"The Quran tells us to say this when we speak about what we will do (18:23-24).","check":false,"n":3000,"r":[],"ph":{"ar":"إِن شَآءَ ٱللَّهُ","translit":"in shāʾa allahu","ref":"18:69","parts":[{"ar":"إِن","say":"if"},{"ar":"شَآءَ","say":"wills"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","say":"God"}]}},"phrase|masha-allah":{"easy":"What God wills (has happened).","kind":"phrase","type":["mashallah","masha allah","mashaallah","masha'allah","what god has willed","whatever god wills","what allah wills"],"note":"In the Quran, a man says it when he sees something good that he has.","check":false,"n":3000,"r":[],"ph":{"ar":"مَا شَآءَ ٱللَّهُ","translit":"mā shāʾa allahu","ref":"18:39","parts":[{"ar":"مَا","say":"what"},{"ar":"شَآءَ","say":"wills"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","say":"God"}]}},"phrase|la-quwwata":{"easy":"There is no power except with God.","kind":"phrase","type":["la quwwata illa billah","la hawla wa la quwwata illa billah","la hawla","no power except with god","there is no power but with allah","hawqala"],"note":null,"check":false,"n":3000,"r":[],"ph":{"ar":"لَا قُوَّةَ إِلَّا بِٱللَّهِ","translit":"lā quwwata illā billahi","ref":"18:39","parts":[{"ar":"لَا","say":"no"},{"ar":"قُوَّةَ","say":"power"},{"ar":"إِلَّا","say":"except"},{"ar":"بِٱللَّهِ","say":"with God"}]}},"phrase|istighfar":{"easy":"And ask God for forgiveness.","kind":"phrase","type":["astaghfirullah","astaghfirallah","astaghfirullah al azeem","i ask god for forgiveness","seek forgiveness","istighfar","ask god for forgiveness","ask for forgiveness"],"note":"The saying people use is أَسْتَغْفِرُ ٱللَّهَ, “I ask God for forgiveness”. This is the Quran’s command form.","check":false,"n":3000,"r":[],"ph":{"ar":"وَٱسْتَغْفِرُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ","translit":"wastaghfirūā allaha","ref":"73:20","parts":[{"ar":"وَٱسْتَغْفِرُوا۟","say":"and ask forgiveness"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","say":"from God"}]}},"phrase|hasbunallah":{"easy":"God is enough for us, and He is the best protector.","kind":"phrase","type":["hasbunallah","hasbunallahu wa niamal wakeel","hasbuna allah","god is enough for us","allah is sufficient for us","hasbiyallah","best protector"],"note":null,"check":false,"n":3000,"r":[],"ph":{"ar":"حَسْبُنَا ٱللَّهُ وَنِعْمَ ٱلْوَكِيلُ","translit":"ḥasbunā allahu waniʿma al-wakīlu","ref":"3:173","parts":[{"ar":"حَسْبُنَا","say":"enough for us is"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","say":"God"},{"ar":"وَنِعْمَ","say":"and what a good"},{"ar":"ٱلْوَكِيلُ","say":"protector, who takes care of everything"}]}},"phrase|tawakkul":{"easy":"Then put your trust in God.","kind":"phrase","type":["tawakkul","tawakkal","tawakkaltu","put your trust in god","trust in god","rely on god","trust in allah","tawakkul ala allah"],"note":null,"check":false,"n":3000,"r":[],"ph":{"ar":"فَتَوَكَّلْ عَلَى ٱللَّهِ","translit":"fatawakkal ʿalā allahi","ref":